  "comment": {
    "text": "Body text of the first step of the AI Agents onboarding tour, under the title \"An agent, not a chat\", shown to an admin while the AI agents sidebar item is highlighted. Contrasts an agent with an ordinary chat: it stays in the list, keeps its own conversation history, settings and a knowledge base built from documents; \"AI agent\" is the product term used across the AI Agents section.",
    "is_auto": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-10-12T12:33:00.821Z",
